==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*20 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*6 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 8 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

If you decide to tackle this stage immediately after [[Korea (Aku Realm)|Korea]], you will struggle quite a lot. The use of an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] who can freeze, slow or massively damage [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] becomes almost a requirement, otherwise [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] (preferably talented), talented [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and meatshields may have to be used, but do not expect much consistency.

As long as your level is at least 5, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is a viable option. Even 4-3 is ok if he has Talents or a [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] (Angel Defence). If so, bring him, [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] with [[Cat Combo]]s for support (Attack or Defence, not required). Ignore [[Gabriel]] and upgrade the [[Worker Cat]] to level 2, then summon Crazed UFO Cat once [[Aku Doge]] gets close and follow by spamming everything except UFOs for the rest of the battle, unless you have money, in which case summoning UFOs will help greatly. Eventually, you will overwhelm the enemies and win.

